  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalStone
  title: "Movers"
  body: "Lever_Gate opens the sliding gate. It stops if anything is underneath, so it never crushes you.\nRide the looping platform across the acid: you move with it.\nLever_Lift raises the lift to the top of the 4 m pillar. A jump only reaches about 2.4 m, so the lift is the only way up."
  closeDistance: 3
