--- !u!114 &1940000017
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1940000015}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 15524a66b3998f499c2af44defc64bb6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalStone
  title: "Push and Pull"
  body: "The block has a mass of 2 kg. Friction holds it with up to f = μ·m·g = (1/3)·2·29.43 ≈ 19.6 N.\nOne player pushes with 12 N: not enough, the forces balance and the block stays still.\nTwo players (24 N) or the Wind Tether (24 N) beat friction: the net force is no longer zero, so it accelerates.\nKinetic Burst gives an impulse of 15 N·s: Δv = J / m = 15 / 2 = 7.5 m/s. The plate needs 45 N."
  closeDistance: 3
