  body: "Gate_B opens only while BOTH plates are pressed (20 N each).\nWeight is the force of gravity on a mass: W = m·g.\n1 kg crate: 29.4 N.   3 kg crate: 88.3 N.   One player: 29.4 N."
  closeDistance: 3
