  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalStone
  title: "Water Currents"
  body: "Every crate here feels the same 25 N current. Newton's second law: a = F_net / m = (F − μ·m·g) / m.\n1 kg: a ≈ 15.2 m/s²   2 kg: a ≈ 2.7 m/s²   3 kg: does not move (25 N < 29.4 N of friction).\nThe same force accelerates a light object much more than a heavy one."
  closeDistance: 3
